  "median": "Duration-weighted inverse-CDF p50 of positive native gauges at exact active C inside its matched wave",
  "peak": "Largest observed positive native live gauge at exact active C inside its matched wave; sampled short-window peak, not a guaranteed instantaneous hardware maximum",
  "limitations": [
    "One pass per version; peaks are noisy and do not establish sustained throughput or model quality.",
    "Only positive decode observations at exact C enter the live gauge median; prefill-only/idle periods and lower-C tails are excluded. Full workflow wall time retains all work and waiting.",
    "Short coverage (<60 s or <30 samples) is explicitly retained and marked; slow positive values are retained.",
    "Same authored task fixtures, real tools/code/tests/repair. This is a controlled agent workflow, not a replay of unmodified production sessions.",
    "The public model alias spans versions; model alias alone is insufficient to select a benchmark generation."
  ],
